{
  "filename": "PlacementRequestInformation",
  "found": true,
  "summary": "PlacementRequestInformation is a business object and workflow that manages healthcare placement requests, including detailed placement data, statuses, actors, workflow steps, business rules, validation logic, calculations, conditions, dependency checks, and system behaviors for student placements across multiple agencies, sites, services, and destinations. The system supports group and individual placements, manages consent and privacy, handles alerts and reminders, validates scheduling, manages exceptions such as cancellations and declines, tracks site instructor assignments, and captures change history for audit and process optimization.",
  "purpose": "To facilitate, track, and manage placement requests for students and staff in healthcare settings. It enables coordination between placing agencies, receiving agencies, sites, services, coordinators, supervisors, and students. The system handles workflows from request creation to assignment, confirmation, changes, alerts, and exceptional conditions.",
